    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "TLS & redirects",
      "items": [
        "TLS re-terminated at envoy-external with the wildcard cert (SNI pinned to <domain>)",
        "The http listener is owned by the cluster-wide https-redirect route — every host 301s"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Control plane",
      "items": [
        "external-dns (gateway-httproute source) reads the target from the parent Gateway, not the route",
